TITLE:: ProbeInspector
summary:: Static DSP Graph (DAG) Signal Flow Visualizer
categories:: GUI>Visualizers, SynthDef

DESCRIPTION::
ProbeInspector renders an interactive topological signal-flow Directed Acyclic Graph (DAG) for any compiled SynthDef or audio Function. It orders UGens in topological dependency layers (Control UGens -> internal DSP arithmetic and filters -> Out UGens), distinguishes signal rates with color-coded bezier routing wires, and enables interactive node inspection.

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
Open a new standalone window inspecting a SynthDef or audio Function.
argument:: synthDef
A link::Classes/SynthDef:: instance, or a link::Classes/Function:: returning a UGen graph.
argument:: theme
A theme name symbol (e.g. \graphite, \phosphor, \ice, \amber, \paper, \monochrome, \puredata) or link::Classes/ProbeTheme:: instance. Default: \graphite.
returns:: A new ProbeInspector instance.

METHOD:: view
Embed the graph inspector into a custom parent link::Classes/View:: or link::Classes/Window::.
argument:: parent
The parent view or window.
argument:: bounds
The link::Classes/Rect:: defining position and dimensions.
argument:: synthDef
A link::Classes/SynthDef:: or audio link::Classes/Function::.
argument:: theme
A theme name symbol or link::Classes/ProbeTheme:: instance. Default: \graphite.
returns:: A PB_GraphView composite view.

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: graphView
returns:: The underlying PB_GraphView composite view.

METHOD:: window
returns:: The link::Classes/Window:: containing the inspector.

METHOD:: close
Close the inspector window.

EXAMPLES::

CODE::
// Inspect an audio Function directly:
ProbeInspector({
    var sig = Saw.ar(MouseX.kr(100, 2000, \exponential));
    var filt = RLPF.ar(sig, 800, 0.2);
    Out.ar(0, filt * 0.2);
});

// Inspect a named SynthDef:
SynthDef(\testSynth, { |freq=440, amp=0.1|
    var osc = SinOsc.ar(freq) * amp;
    Out.ar(0, osc ! 2);
}).add;

ProbeInspector(SynthDescLib.global[\testSynth].def, \ice);
::
